# Mosquitto Access Control List (ACL) for Homing Hub Smart Home System

# ==============================================================================
# 1. Homing Hub Backend Service
# Full administrative read/write access to all homing & homeassistant topics
# ==============================================================================
user homing_backend
topic readwrite homing/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic read $SYS/#

# ==============================================================================
# 2. ESP32 Physical Hardware Devices (Common device account or per-device user)
# ==============================================================================
user esp32_device
topic read homing/devices/+/command
topic write homing/devices/+/state
topic write homing/devices/+/ack
topic write homing/devices/+/lwt
topic write homing/nodes/+/lwt
topic write homing/discovery

# ==============================================================================
# 3. Read-Only Viewer / Web Dashboard Client (Optional)
# ==============================================================================
user homing_viewer
topic read homing/devices/+/state
topic read homing/simulator/devices/+/state
topic read homeassistant/+/+/state
